   {
    "text": "The Lindley-Scott House was built in 1911 for Charles Lindley, president of the Foothill Ranch. Later, Mabelle Scott Anderson, owner of the Mabelle Scott Rancho School for Girls, acquired the house. The name of the house was derived from these two owners.",
