   {
    "text": "About us page The Historic Lindley-Scott House has been serving the San Gabriel Valley and surrounding areas since 1978 with personalized weddings, wedding receptions, Banquet Facilities, and Catering. Our Wedding Chapel is open year-round, located in the city of Azusa close to the San Gabriel Mount",
